#: app/components/staff/labor/labor-overview.tsx:107
msgid "Wages and sales are in different currencies, so they are shown separately and left out of the share. Amounts are never converted."
msgstr "الأجور والمبيعات بعملات مختلفة، لذا تُعرض منفصلة وتُستبعد من النسبة. لا تُحوَّل المبالغ أبدًا."

#: app/components/staff/labor/labor-overview.tsx:271
msgid "Wages are estimates from each card's rate and your overtime rules, not payroll. The share is wages divided by sales over the days that have sales, not an average of daily shares."
